--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: AFU_Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 16bec568f3680914b892c4018b766c2f, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 47017676951552
    m_Localized: Hello young one! You look like you dont know anything about anything..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 314257315909632
    m_Localized: Buuuuttttttttt..... you MIGHT want to sneak into the park using
      "LEFT CTRL"...whatever that means...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47031874670592
    m_Localized: All my flo-
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47051256549376
    m_Localized: ANYWAYYY *Didn't ask your whole life story here*
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47061553565696
    m_Localized: I have this old nest in the park up here if you want it? It's a
      fixer-upper but still....good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 314243671838720
    m_Localized: Try heading EAST to the most popular park in town. There's bounmd
      to be sticks there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53441740066816
    m_Localized: Alright
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53560052994048
    m_Localized: GREAT! Follow me to your newww home!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 314207697293312
    m_Localized: Back in my day we would sleep on spikes and be HAPPY. *scoff*...Okay
      maybe you could spruce it up with 3 more sticks to make it cozier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53686830026752
    m_Localized: Are pigeon nest supposed to look that....bad?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858535531433984
    m_Localized: AHHHHHHH!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858615307096064
    m_Localized: Oh-- It's you! You have to stop scaring the feathers off me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858656721653760
    m_Localized: Almost ruined my hiding spot as well!! Those humans over there knocked
      the plumage off me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858676174835712
    m_Localized: Did you know that legend says we once helped humans? Carried mail
      thousands of kilometers for them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858715718733824
    m_Localized: We were heroes! Sky messengers! Tiny feathery delivery legends!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858725592125440
    m_Localized: Sounds crazy, I know. Now they mostly just chase and yell at us.
      Soo SCARY! Humans are unpredictable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858767568719872
    m_Localized: "They tend to throw things, kick, or chase you if they spot you.
      So when you wanna be invisible\u2026 you gotta sneak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858778331303936
    m_Localized: Hold down LEFT CTRL OR LEFT BUMPER and move slowly. Stay behind
      stuff. Boxes. Benches. Fences. Decorative shrubbery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858793414021120
    m_Localized: "To sprint hold down the LEFT SHIFT OR L3.  It will take you out
      of the stealth mode so be speedy!! If you see something you want\u2026 snatch
      it up with F."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858805535559680
    m_Localized: "Feeling confident?  I need some help. I\u2019ve lost my ..hat\u2026
      in the theater! And it\u2019s crowded with people!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858816449138688
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s actually my night light. A jar of fireflies. I can\u2019t
      sleep without it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858827740205056
    m_Localized: "YOU WILL?! Oh thank goodness. Okay okay. Sneak past the humans.Use
      objects for cover. If they see you\u2026 you better move those little feet!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858854894129152
    m_Localized: "Oh. That\u2019s okay. Totally fine. I\u2019ll just\u2026Never sleep
      again. We can practice sneaking more. That\u2019s good. I like practice. Practice
      is safe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858866810146816
    m_Localized: Just kidding, I NEED my nightlight. NOW!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858879363698688
    m_Localized: "YOU DID IT!!! You\u2019re the bravest bird I know. Which is not
      a high bar but still!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858898321952768
    m_Localized: "OMG! HI!! You\u2019re here!! Okay okay okay don\u2019t freak out
      but I found the BEST stuff!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858909378138112
    m_Localized: "It was in a garbage can!! Which means it\u2019s premium."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858920618872832
    m_Localized: "Okay so like \u2014 see shiny? Or crunchy? Or vaguely food-shaped?
      You can pick it up! Just press F OR Y to grab it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858930215440384
    m_Localized: "YES!! Put it in your wingventory! That\u2019s your treasure pocket!
      Press I OR UP DIRECTION PAD to check out what you got."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858930601316352
    m_Localized: " Now here\u2019s the IMPORTANT part. Use LEFT CLICK OR RIGHT TRIGGER
      to poop on those pesky humans! And RIGHT CLICK OR LEFT TRIGGER to aim so you
      waste less!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858949450518528
    m_Localized: When your poop meter gets low? You gotta eat. Garbage snacks fill
      it back up. Nature is BEAUTIFUL.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858957461639168
    m_Localized: "Garbage cans are like mystery boxes! Use E OR X BUTTON to interact!
      You never know what you\u2019ll get!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858965699252224
    m_Localized: "Maybe fries. Maybe bread. Maybe something that builds character.
      If it wiggles, maybe don\u2019t."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858974268215296
    m_Localized: Hey there little man!! You ready to learn some sick moves?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858985622196224
    m_Localized: "Relax your feathers. The sky\u2019s chill. It only looks big. Okay
      yeah it\u2019s massive. But you\u2019ll be fine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12858996628049920
    m_Localized: Alright, mannn. You know the basics but you want more! First thing?
      Lift off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12859006878928896
    m_Localized: "Use WASD OR RIGHT STICK that Birdadette taught to control where
      you\u2019re flying to. Don\u2019t fight the wind \u2014 vibe with it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12859020745297920
    m_Localized: "Release you\u2019re flight button, and just glide on down. Flying
      fast is easy. Flying cool? That\u2019s skill."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12859032170582016
    m_Localized: Now bring it in. Wanna dive down quickly? Use Q. Maybe a softer
      approach? Hover with G or just glide on down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12859043797192704
    m_Localized: "Last move. Perch. Spots you can perchwill have a handy little symbol
      letting you know it\u2019s a chill hang spot. Line up slow. Feet forward. Let
      it catch you. Press E when you see that icon!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12859055969062912
    m_Localized: Now let's see you put it all together. Look for race posters like
      the one on this sign and test your wings! Show me what you got!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
